<title>DUBAI: GOLF-DUBAI DESERT CLASSIC FIRST ROUND SCORES.</title>
<headline>GOLF-DUBAI DESERT CLASSIC FIRST ROUND SCORES.</headline>
<dateline>DUBAI 1997-02-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Leading scores in the first round</p>
<p>of the Dubai Desert Classic on Thursday:</p>
<p>65 Domingo Hospital (Spain), Colin Montgomerie (Britain)</p>
<p>66 Mark James (Britain), Bernhard Langer (Germany),</p>
<p>Padraig Harrington (Ireland), Eamonn Darcy (Ireland)</p>
<p>67 Jean Van de Velde (France)</p>
<p>68 Fabrice Tarnaud (France), Klas Eriksson (Sweden),</p>
<p>Raymond Burns, Prayad Marksaeng (Thailand), Mats</p>
<p>Hallberg (Sweden), Robert Willis (Australia)</p>
<p>69 Jeev Singh (India), Robert Coles (Britain), Ian</p>
<p>Woosnam (Britain), Malcolm Mackenzie (Britain),</p>
<p>David Howell (Britain), Peter Baker (Britain),</p>
<p>Thomas Goegele (Germany), Robert Lee (Britain), Roger Chapman</p>
<p>(Britain), Per-Ulrik Johansson Sweden), Paul</p>
<p>McGinley (Ireland), David Gilford (Britain), Jose</p>
<p>Maria Olazabal (Spain), Andrew Oldcorn (Britain)</p>
<p>70 Miles Tunnicliff (Britain), Peter Mitchell (Britain),</p>
<p>Miguel Angel Martin (Spain), Richard Green</p>
<p>(Australia), Phillip Price Britain), Paul Lawrie</p>
<p>(Britain), Carl Suneson (Spain), Chang Tse-peng</p>
<p>(Taiwan), Mark Mouland (Britain), Jon Robson</p>
<p>(Britain), Jose Coceres (Argentina), Costantino Rocca</p>
<p>(Italy), Retief Goosen (South Africa)</p>
<p>NOTE: Nine players still to complete their first round on</p>
<p>Friday.</p>
